# post-packages.list: what seclegion-post installs into the target (one per line).
# seclegion-keyring comes first and alone (post.py installs it, populates the key, then the rest).
# The list must cover iso/packages/desktop.list (tests/install/test_post.py checks it).
# ufw is in no ISO list yet: it must join the offline cache before the installer can run offline.
