# Dev profile (docs/DAILY-DRIVER.md gap 2): develop SecLegion on SecLegion. openssh is the client only
# (post.py masks every sshd unit); the offline cache gets it as a dependency (gvfs -> gcr-4 -> openssh),
# since the iso lists may not name it (tests/iso/test_m2_static.py, docs/decisions.md M2-openssh).
